# EduFlex AI

EduFlex AI is an AI-powered personalized learning assistant.

## Problem
Students have different learning speeds and different learning gaps.
Traditional learning often gives the same study material and study plan to everyone.

## Solution
EduFlex AI analyzes study materials and student performance to provide personalized learning support.

## Key Features
- PDF study material analysis
- AI Chat Assistant
- AI-generated practice tests
- Weak-topic identification
- Personalized study plan
- Progress graphs
- Points, medals and badges
- Student progress tracking

## Technology
- React
- TypeScript
- Vite
- Node.js
- Express
- SQL
- Gemini AI

## Goal
To help students learn at their own pace, improve weak areas and stay motivated.
